  "changes": "The signature upgrade below Feed 1 has a smooth 2.5-second growing and shrinking gold backdrop in all three areas. Locked, available and unaffordable states pulse; owned uses half opacity. Reduced Motion uses a static highlight. Node art, hit bounds, cards, camera, costs and gates stay fixed. Offscreen and inactive views stop animating. Peg earnings show gold +amount with a dark gold outline and no coin symbol or icon spacing. Actual credited coins, break rewards, merging and stationary Reduced Motion behavior are retained. Global bottom notifications are removed from Home and other pages, along with their invisible map input blockers and notification-driven redraws. Existing inline card messages and transactional note state remain supported.",
